  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the lamb and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the berbere spice, salt, and pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the ferment-jang and stir to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, for 10 minutes.",
    "Stir in the flaked almonds and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional almonds if desired."
